<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`PRIM_REFLECTION_PROBE_MIRROR: number = 4`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer PRIM_REFLECTION_PROBE_MIRROR = 4;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_REFLECTION_PROBE_MIRROR has the value 4</p>
  <p>Used with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_REFLECTION_PROBE" target="_blank">PRIM_REFLECTION_PROBE</a>. When enabled, objects with low-roughness PBR materials objects act as a mirror. Note that mirrors do not reflect avatars unless <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_REFLECTION_PROBE_DYNAMIC" target="_blank">PRIM_REFLECTION_PROBE_DYNAMIC</a> is also set. Rendering mirrors has a performance cost.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>ReflectionProbeType</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
